spes: SIM bring-up and registration (0202; modem_nas=1, modem_online=1).

all-1: UIM said "card absent" in both slots with a SIM inserted: 0200 asked once, ~0.5 s after the
service appeared, before UIM had looked at the cards. Now card status every 30 s until a card is READY.
Then, as HackiOS hakios.mpss.c (cycles 30-37): logical slot 1 pointed at the physical slot with the READY
card (UIM Switch Slot 0x46) when slot 1 has none; the READY/detected USIM of slot 1 made the primary GW
application when none is (Change Provisioning Session 0x38; AID sent, never logged). modem_online=1 adds
DMS Get/Set Operating Mode online (0x2D/0x2E) after 5 s and NAS Initiate Network Register automatic (0x22)
once a card is ready. The modem's EFS writes stay in RAM (rmtfs): nothing persists. Application parsing
fixed (type, state, perso state, feature, 2 retries, AID length + AID, 7 PIN bytes).

